    "caption": "The Rock's Rolex broke on live TV. As a boy, Dwayne Johnson believed every successful man owns a Rolex with diamonds. A few years into his wrestling career he finally bought one, while still renting his apartment, and later called it a horrible financial decision. He wore it into the ring for a live interview, a brawl broke out, a wrestler fell on the watch and it broke. That night he decided it was a sign, and he has never bought anything like it again. He told the story to Oprah in 2020. He bought that Rolex in 1999.",
